  "details": "Description\n\nMy UI freezes. I can still hit ESC and other keys and see it but I just can't click it. My text box also stops. My R menu as well. And I'm not able to grab objects anymoe. My voice and movement continue to work though. It's been occuring suddenly everytime I log in into VRchat after a few minutes of gameplay~I can't even add people or leave the instances~\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI just joined an instance with other people and it initiated after some minutes. even when the instances were not crowded~\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
